      <p>
        The two algorithms worth reading up on rather than taking on trust:
        <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ramer%E2%80%93Douglas%E2%80%93Peucker_algorithm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ramer&ndash;Douglas&ndash;Peucker</a>
